msgid "Limit in-memory mail cache to reduce RAM usage"
msgstr "限制内存中的邮件缓存以减少 RAM 占用"

#: data/com.martingawron.Meridian.gschema.xml:1
msgid "When false, all locally cached message headers (up to 25,000 per folder) are loaded into memory for instant full-mailbox search and filtering. When true, only mail-sync-message-limit messages per folder are kept in memory initially."
msgstr "设为 false 时，所有本地缓存的邮件头（每文件夹多达 25,000 个）都会加载到内存中以实现即时全邮箱搜索和过滤。设为 true 时，初始每个文件夹仅在内存中保留 mail-sync-message-limit 封邮件。"

#: data/com.martingawron.Meridian.gschema.xml:1
msgid "Draft autosave interval in seconds (0 disables local autosave)"
msgstr "草稿自动保存间隔（秒，0 表示禁用本地自动保存）"

